WEBVTT

NOTE Tears of Steel (Blender Foundation, 2012, CC BY 3.0, https://mango.blender.org). Excerpt 00:18–01:06 of the 720p release.
NOTE Standard track re-timed from the official TOS-en.srt (offset −18 s). Speaker names from the film's credits: Celia, Thom.
NOTE The on-screen title "Forty years later" is not dialogue and is not captioned.

c001
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:06.500
<v Celia>You're a jerk, Thom.

c002
00:00:06.580 --> 00:00:09.000
<v Thom>Look Celia, we have to follow our passions;

c003
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:12.720
<v Thom>...you have your robotics, and I
just want to be awesome in space.

c004
00:00:12.800 --> 00:00:16.420
<v Celia>Why don't you just admit that
you're freaked out by my robot hand?

c005
00:00:16.500 --> 00:00:18.500
<v Thom>I'm not freaked out by- it's...

c006
00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:20.000
<v Thom>...alright! Fine!

c007
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:23.000
<v Thom>I'm freaked out! I have nightmares
that I'm being chased...

c008
00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:24.120
<v Thom>...by these giant robotic claws of death...

c009
00:00:24.200 --> 00:00:27.000
<v Celia>Whatever, Thom. We're done.

c010
00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:35.500
<v Technician>Robot's memory synced and locked!

c011
00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:45.000
<v Crew>This is pretty freaky.
